{'symbol': 'MDT', 'date': '2023-03-23 19:41:00', 'title': 'MEDTRONIC ANNOUNCES PRICING OF $2.0 BILLION OF SENIOR NOTES', 'text': 'DUBLIN , MARCH 23, 2023 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- MEDTRONIC PLC (THE "COMPANY") (NYSE: MDT) ANNOUNCED TODAY THAT ITS WHOLLY-OWNED SUBSIDIARY, MEDTRONIC GLOBAL HOLDINGS S.C.A. ("MEDTRONIC LUXCO"), HAS PRICED AN OFFERING (THE "OFFERING") OF $1,000,000,000 PRINCIPAL AMOUNT OF 4.25% SENIOR NOTES DUE 2028 AND $1,000,000,000\xa0PRINCIPAL AMOUNT OF 4.50% SENIOR NOTES DUE 2033\xa0(COLLECTIVELY, THE "NOTES").'}